  "how": "Submit runs 13 hidden tests. Each answer must equal the expected value.",
  "solution": "#include <vector>\n#include <unordered_set>\n\nint first_missing_positive(std::vector<int> nums) {\n    std::unordered_set<int> seen(nums.begin(), nums.end());\n    int m = 1;\n    while (seen.count(m)) ++m;\n    return m;\n}\n",
  "notes": [
    "A set answers 'is `m` present' in constant time.",
    "The answer is at most $n + 1$, so the count-up loop is short.",
    "Building the set and the loop are both $O(n)$."
  ]
}
